WEBVTT

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.630
friends that you want to stay with forever...

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:12.490
were called called "BFFs".

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.670
It's a somewhat interesting word, and I liked it.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.910
The three of us are best friends forever.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.800
Even now,

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.250
I feel like they're right here beside me.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.100
Thanks for helping me clean the blackboard!

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.770
It's fine! I usually have it easy as the health officer!

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:45.210
And Sumi is a bit ruthless as person-in-charge...

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.730
We will be heading towards the morning assembly, and I will roast anyone who's noisy!

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:52.700
That phrase is something you don't hear often these days...

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:53.440
Right?

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:00.930
On the topic of duties, the fourth Vertex hasn't arrived, huh.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.290
Our trip is coming up soon.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.210
I hope it doesn't arrive then.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.920
About that trip...

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.760
Is it okay for us to be that
far away from the city?

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:14.130
It's a short trip to the Great Bridge
in Hero form, so no worries!

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.010
I really hope it doesn't arrive, though.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.180
You won't get anything done
if you keep over-thinking it.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.720
You have a point.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:24.630
Well, if anything happens,
this Hero will do something about it!

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.440
Wow! Mino-san, you're so cool!

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.980
That's right. With the three of us there,
everything will be okay!

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.610
I understand.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.030
Thank you.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.010
Awww...

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:13.490
My hands are all prickly and painful.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.340
Today's training was so hard...

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:18.970
Why don't you try changing the
way you grip your spear?

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:22.650
Sensei said changing it won't help,
that's just how it is.

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:25.640
There there. Pain, pain, go away!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.600
I'll leave these for you two to look at.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.080
S-Sumi-san, what are these?!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.590
As you can see, these are school trip guidebooks!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.900
I've sent the digital version to your phones.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.320
Did you make these just for us?

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:46.330
I got so excited I stayed up all night
and added more things to our trip plan.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:51.110
Wasshi, you're the type who get easily
absorbed by excitement, aren't you?

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:55.790
Whoever gets to be Sumi's husband in the future is gonna be happy, but they'll certainly have their hands full.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.080
What are you talking about all of a sudden?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.340
If only there was some guy out
there like me, that'd be great!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.790
You two would make a great pair!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:09.350
A-Anyway, use this guidebook to make
preparations for the trip, okay?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.560
If you're late, I'll roast you.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.890
Where did you even get that thing from?

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:14.660
From Ines.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:17.460
Nice Ines! Yay!

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.290
Y-Yay...

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.440
Yeah!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.820
With that, I'm all set.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.310
Vroooooom! Dabaaam!

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.630
Rawr!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.080
Run away!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.540
I'll let Sumi know I'm done.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.480
Ah, to put our dirty clothes in?

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.430
A plastic bag, huh?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.160
No matter how many times I look, he's as cute as always!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:50.680
You're open!
No matter how many times I look, he's as cute as always!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.020
You're open!

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.190
Why you—!

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:57.560
You're gonna need more than
that to bring a Hero down!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.250
Hey, Nee-chan, get me a souvenir!

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.900
Is that all you ever think about?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:03.960
Sure!

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.030
Yay!

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:08.440
In exchange, why don't you keep an eye
on Kintarou for me while I'm gone?

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:09.410
Yeah!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.250
I wonder if he's going to start crawling soon.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.080
Right? I'm looking forward to it!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.270
As Heroes, we have to play
on the athletic course!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.360
This is pretty fun!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.700
You two are too fast!
Wait for me!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.440
Uwaaah, it's shaking!

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:53.040
Nogi-san, you don't have to be so scared.
It's really shaking! O-Oh nooo!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:58.300
When you think that there's a bottomless
pit below you, it gets pretty thrilling.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.900
That's some impressive imagination.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:04.670
You must not step on the fifth tire.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.670
Eh?
Eh?

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:10.160
It's the end if you touch it. You'll be visited by a fallen warrior's ghost night after night,

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.560
hearing him whisper "Give me back my rice field..."

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.090
What good is it gonna do to scare her?

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:19.980
Well, she was looking for a thrill,
so I thought I'd give her one.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:23.320
C'mon, one more time! Heroes do it
with fighting spirit and guts!

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:24.780
Heroes do it—

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.570
with fighting spirit and guts!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.280
Nice job! You did well.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.770
Now that I'm used to it, the next
time will go much better!

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.360
What are you doing, Sumi?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:41.750
You two were getting along so well,
I wanted in, too!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.180
What are you, a dog?

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:47.160
I'm sure Wasshi wants to have her head patted by you, also.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.040
You're really good at it, Mino-san!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.140
So, you wanted to be spoiled?

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.630
There, there.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.080
Gin-chan, catch us, too!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.980
All right, come at me!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.790
She's a really popular girl, that Gin.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.360
She's always been popular.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.860
Hey, Gin-chan.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.200
What's up?

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:10.240
Actually, my sister asked me if I
could get your autograph.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:10.820
Eh?

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:14.830
I think she became your fan when I told
her that you had an important duty.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.450
Ah, I see!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:21.040
I'm already a person who has
to give autographs, huh?

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:31.160
Once we climb this, we can have lunch!

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.340
Okay!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.160
Well, this seems a bit easy.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:40.190
I can climb this thing with one hand!

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.770
Hey, Gin, stop fooling around!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.190
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.020
My hand!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.190
Look out!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.540
Are you okay, Mino-san?

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.700
Yeah, just surprised.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:55.900
Gin, I understand you're having fun,
but aren't you being a bit careless?

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:58.830
Think about the importance of your duty.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.400
I'll return the favor, and I'll reflect on my actions.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:06.540
I'll be less cocky!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.760
Yes, that's good.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.500
You're really skilled, Minowa-san.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.390
I help out at home from time to time.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.050
That said, this smells so good!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:22.820
This'll definitely be great!
I made it, after all!

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.400
Gin, didn't you say you'll be less cocky?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.460
Such a tomboy, isn't she?

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:30.510
I think you're quite the
tomboy yourself, Sonocchi.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.150
Oh, Wasshi, you aren't good with bugs, are you?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.280
Don't worry, you'll be friends soon enough.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.410
Y-You think?

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:43.150
They only look like cockroaches to me!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.800
Delicious! This is the best!

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:50.080
It tastes like Rhino beetle!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.520
I didn't grill any of those!

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:53.230
It's delicious!

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.240
Don't you eat better meat than this, Sonoko?

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.730
This meat is much more delicious.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:00.560
Maybe it's because you're
eating it with everyone?

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:01.770
Ah!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.310
Sonoko, your mouth.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.100
Thank you!

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.760
You go from happy to sad
in no time at all, huh?

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:14.460
It's because Wasshi and Mino-san
were able to cook while I couldn't.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:17.540
I'm suddenly embarrassed at myself.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:20.200
You can make something easy
like yakisoba too, Sonoko.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.000
Then, how 'bout you and Wasshi
teach me next Sunday?

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.770
That's fine.
That's fine.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.370
We're in sync!

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.090
By the way...

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.840
Sensei, are you not going to
eat your green peppers?

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.720
I'll eat them! It's just that I don't really like them...

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.150
Did something happen in a previous life?

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:45.390
At times like these I like to imagine that if I eat it, a green pepper fairy will visit me at night!

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:48.910
Th-That's a unique... insight. Th-Thank you...

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.150
I think I might be able to eat it, now...

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.100
Sensei praised you!

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:55.610
As a reward, I'll let Sonoko ring the bell!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:57.110
Bell?

00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:01.290
We cleared the entire athletic course!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.990
Mission accomplished, huh?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.880
Sumi, is that our town over there?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.540
Yeah, that's it.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:17.770
I can't even see the Great Bridge
or Ines from here.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:20.760
You really love Ines don't you, Mino-san?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.220
Ines is great! It has everything!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.580
Even the community center is there.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:26.880
Bingo!

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.750
I also knew.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.990
You can read me like a book already, huh?

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.690
Can you read me, too?

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.540
I can't read you at all, Sonocchi.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.530
We might never be able to.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.200
That makes me feel kind of left out...

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.970
Don't worry, I could see that
reaction coming, at least.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:49.240
That weird bouncing around
was unpredictable, though.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.960
Sonocchi's amazing...

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:56.000
By the way, I'm a certified Sumi expert now.
I could write an instruction manual about you.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.570
Oh my! I wonder what you'd
write in the foreword?

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:04.090
This product is rather volatile and difficult to operate,
so please handle with care.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:07.440
S-Sounds like someone annoying.

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:09.600
But I can't really deny it.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.030
There's nothing wrong with
it being a bit thick.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.400
Mine'd probably be as thin
as a flyer in a newspaper.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.130
That's not true!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:20.740
You might be easy to understand,
but there'd still be lot to write about!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.700
Y-You think so?

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:26.180
I want to expose even more
sides of you in the future!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.300
Please go easy on me!

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:33.040
Actually, I didn't know how to deal
with you at first, Mino-san.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.040
Why'd you suddenly say that?!

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.380
Same for me.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.330
Hey!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:42.980
You know, you were so cheerful and into sports.
You seemed like a different species.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:46.320
But you were actually really
nice when I tried to talk to you!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.190
And Wasshi's a nice character, too!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:49.310
I'm a character!?

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.120
I see.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:56.360
You can't know these things
until you talk to someone.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.150
I'm glad that you ended up liking me.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.420
I'll be counting on you as
a buddy from now on!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.060
Me, too!

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.030
Sure!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.340
Today was fun!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.450
You're going to trip, Sonocchi.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.040
I wish we could go on field trips like this every day!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.180
I agree!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.920
Is this...

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.060
It's the enemy!

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:12.060
Aww, and we were having
so much fun today, too.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.900
Appearing at the last minute like this...

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.610
They're really mean!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:22.110
I think it's better that they came after the trip was over.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.990
The field trip isn't over until we get home, Gin.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.570
Are you a teacher?

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:31.290
Let's wrap this up quickly so I
can take my souvenirs home.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.590
We've gotten pretty familiar
with this scenery now, huh?

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:32.970
Careful, Gin. That kind of thinking is—

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.750
The most dangerous, right?

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:40.310
Its okay, my outfit is hardened for
close quarters combat!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.450
That's why I'm telling you...
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.760
You almost got hurt at the
athletic course earlier.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:50.990
Mino-san, lately, it seems that you've been
letting Wasshi tell you off on purpose.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.290
Seems like I've made a habit
of making Sumi mad.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.500
Give me a break, will you...

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.210
It's here!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.550
What?! There's two of them?!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.130
So that's how it is...

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.800
If we work together, we can
handle even two of them!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.010
That's the spirit!

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:15.660
Mino-san and I will take on one each.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.720
Wasshi, you cover us from the rear, okay?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.350
Leave it to me, Sonocchi!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.310
Here I go!

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.470
I'll handle the creepy one!

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:36.240
I think they're both pretty creepy though...

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.580
Take this!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.080
He's easy to read.
This is perfect for me!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.260
Nice!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.510
Looks like getting hit by that would hurt.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.560
There!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.820
We have the upper hand.
We'll push them back like this!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:10.940
Oh crap!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:11.610
This is bad!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.110
Everyone! Over here!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.910
What the hell is this?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.150
Sumi! Sonoko!

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:34.450
Are you okay? Sonoko! Sumi!

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.050
That thing fired those arrows...

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.080
Gin...

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.210
Looks like I'm the only one who can still move.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.680
It may be scary, but I'll take it from here.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:13.050
Leave this to me. You two rest for a bit.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.180
See ya.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:21.140
Gin... Gin...

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.570
Those bastards!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:42.510
You've made it pretty far...

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.540
But beyond this line...

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.910
Not one step further!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.760
I remember that attack!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.850
And the one after that!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.560
I've seen that one before!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.230
What are you doing up there?!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.950
Now... you've done it!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.080
That really hurt!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.510
Try getting hit by one yourself!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.380
All of you need to...

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.590
GET THE HELL OUT!!!

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:07.380
If these things destroy the Shinju-sama...

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.110
Like I'd let them...

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:25.100
I wont...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.350
let them!

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.850
No way!

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.900
I'll return!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.150
I'll protect them!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:46.620
You monsters wouldn't understand
this kind of strength!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:54.580
This is what it means to be human!

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.170
This is determination!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.050
This is willpower!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:17.190
It's our spirit!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.130
The enemies are...

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:43.800
Wasshi, over there!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.850
Gin...

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.850
We'll be right there.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.320
Gin!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.400
Mino-san!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.730
Mino-san, you drove them all away, didn't you!

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:11.440
You're amazing Gin! You're really...

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.910
G-Gin...

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:22.690
The Jukai will revert soon.

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:26.090
Once we're out, we'll go to the
hospital together, okay?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.470
Y-Yeah...

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:33.850
You still need to give your little
brother his souvenirs, right?

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:09.110
You said...

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:12.600
You'd teach me how to cook....

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:15.430
That's right!

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:19.230
Next Sunday... The three of us...

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.710
Hey, Gin...

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:24.730
Gin...
